@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
title Solana integration: program planned, daemon reads preserved
top to bottom direction

component "Owner dashboard + wallet\n(planned)" as Browser #EAF2FF
artifact "Provider Bash script\nOperator-run (planned)" as Setup #EAF2FF
component "solana-authd\n(implemented)" as AuthD #FFF0D9
cloud "Devnet RPC" as RPC #EDE4FF

node "Solana runtime" #EDE4FF {
  component "Billing/access program\n(planned)" as Program #EDE4FF
  database "Program-owned accounts\nServerRecord / Subscription\nAccessGrant / PaymentReceipt" as Accounts #EDE4FF
  component "System Program" as System #EDE4FF
  artifact "Provider treasury" as Treasury #EDE4FF
}

Browser --> RPC : Purchase / renew / delegation\nRead receipts + access
Setup --> RPC : Register / enable / disable
AuthD --> RPC : Read finalized authorization snapshot
RPC --> Program : Submit signed instructions
RPC --> Accounts : Read finalized state
Program --> Accounts : Validate and update
Program --> System : Native SOL transfer
System --> Treasury : Exact configured lamports

note bottom of Program
  Payment, receipt, subscription, and owner grant
  update atomically; reused payment IDs are rejected.
  Preserve the existing daemon's account layouts and PDAs.
end note
note bottom of AuthD
  Login performs no transaction or SOL transfer.
  PaymentReceipt is not part of the login snapshot.
end note
@enduml
